<body>
<p>The &nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{!SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE( SUBSTITUTE(relatedTo.Name, 'Need', ''), 'verify eligibility', '' ), 'collected', '')}" escape="false"/> for ({!relatedTo.pse__Project__r.pse__Account__r.Name}) ({!relatedTo.pse__Project__r.pse__Account__r.NSP_AIMS_Client__c}) is attached.</p>
</body>
